            "type": "game",
            "name": "Melon Simulator™",
            "steam_appid": 437550,
            "required_age": "12",
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h1>Workshop Level Editor</h1><p>Create, share, and play custom levels with Melon Simulator's in-game level editor.  Custom levels work in multiplayer too, so you can play them with your friends!</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/437550/extras/5ab7349c1635164d3e1b87edfed4f9eb.poster.avif?t=1791050527\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/437550/extras/5ab7349c1635164d3e1b87edfed4f9eb.webm?t=1791050527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/437550/extras/5ab7349c1635164d3e1b87edfed4f9eb.mp4?t=1791050527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melon Simulator™ is a chaotic, multiplayer (<u>1 - 4 players</u>), first person melee combat game.  Play as a member of the Melon Inc. Containment Unit, responding to a failed melon simulation.  Work with your teammates to survive the oncoming melon horde and compete for the top spot on the worldwide leaderboards.  The longer you survive, the harder it gets.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WEAPONS</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost anything that isn't nailed down can be used to whack, slice, and throw at the oncoming melon horde... katanas, machetes, paintings, melon chunks, wooden baseball bats, metal baseball bats, spiked baseball bats, planks, spiked planks, sign letters, speakers, bricks, benches, doors, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LEVEL EDITOR</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Melon Simulator's in-game level editor you can create, share, and play custom levels.  Custom levels work in multiplayer too, so you can play them with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/437550/extras/109a55fddecbb0a27ca94ee523382294.poster.avif?t=1791050527\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/437550/extras/109a55fddecbb0a27ca94ee523382294.webm?t=1791050527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/437550/extras/109a55fddecbb0a27ca94ee523382294.mp4?t=1791050527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/437550/extras/c41474c5d38d575ff34c21a1dc010e40.poster.avif?t=1791050527\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/437550/extras/c41474c5d38d575ff34c21a1dc010e40.webm?t=1791050527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/437550/extras/c41474c5d38d575ff34c21a1dc010e40.mp4?t=1791050527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/437550/extras/5ab7349c1635164d3e1b87edfed4f9eb.poster.avif?t=1791050527\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/437550/extras/5ab7349c1635164d3e1b87edfed4f9eb.webm?t=1791050527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/437550/extras/5ab7349c1635164d3e1b87edfed4f9eb.mp4?t=1791050527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melon Simulator™ is a chaotic, multiplayer (<u>1 - 4 players</u>), first person melee combat game.  Play as a member of the Melon Inc. Containment Unit, responding to a failed melon simulation.  Work with your teammates to survive the oncoming melon horde and compete for the top spot on the worldwide leaderboards.  The longer you survive, the harder it gets.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WEAPONS</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost anything that isn't nailed down can be used to whack, slice, and throw at the oncoming melon horde... katanas, machetes, paintings, melon chunks, wooden baseball bats, metal baseball bats, spiked baseball bats, planks, spiked planks, sign letters, speakers, bricks, benches, doors, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LEVEL EDITOR</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Melon Simulator's in-game level editor you can create, share, and play custom levels.  Custom levels work in multiplayer too, so you can play them with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/437550/extras/109a55fddecbb0a27ca94ee523382294.poster.avif?t=1791050527\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/437550/extras/109a55fddecbb0a27ca94ee523382294.webm?t=1791050527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/437550/extras/109a55fddecbb0a27ca94ee523382294.mp4?t=1791050527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/437550/extras/c41474c5d38d575ff34c21a1dc010e40.poster.avif?t=1791050527\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/437550/extras/c41474c5d38d575ff34c21a1dc010e40.webm?t=1791050527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/437550/extras/c41474c5d38d575ff34c21a1dc010e40.mp4?t=1791050527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
